<unit id="ac73953b-21cb-4a50-afa5-da109d52990a">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 2</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: # </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>URL Shortener #</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="ba2cb0ad-81e4-4e17-ae33-4e8be85258c5">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 4</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Author: Noelia Ruiz Martínez</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="aa43a378-c7e9-4f6f-9c50-f97478d61225">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 6</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>This add-on is used to shorten URLs from NVDA through [is.gd][1].</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="043f951c-731e-4179-a791-f053c91bb6e0">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 8</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Shorten URL dialog ##</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="3ca61ee9-478b-465b-91d5-1a5544dcf77e">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 10</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Go to NVDA's menu, Tools submenu, and activate the Shorten URL item.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="e21b3d90-6218-4292-8bd4-6e2d60f37895">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 12</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Alternatively, you can assign a gesture from the Input gestures dialog of NVDA.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="cf7f4d42-97a4-4e50-ab9d-18a09c40c37f">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 14</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>The Shorten URL dialog includes the following controls:</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="4624b9b3-e375-468d-a3be-3c0297d58086">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 16</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>A list to select one of the saved URLs. From this list, Press shift+tab to search, and tab to press one of the following buttons.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="0833ddba-de3f-4ebc-98bd-c131cb813816">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 17</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Copy shortened URL. This can also be activated by pressing Enter from the URLs list.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="6dc2b6ed-df03-4377-8154-1949e12088c9">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 18</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>A readonly box showing details about the selected URL.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="b494b9ce-4de9-4c93-8254-99408166b72f">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 19</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Set of controls to shorten a new URL: Provide the new URL; optionally, you can set a display name and a custom subfix for the shortened URL. Finally, press the Shorten URL button.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="d97d02f2-3cf8-4992-acad-7bada06552aa">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 20</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Rename: opens a dialog to provide a new name to display the selected URL on the list.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="9d048c22-bc19-498d-80c3-aab975c3494d">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 21</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Delete: opens a dialog to delete the selected URL.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="0abf494c-186d-4a2d-bdf0-4940be33629e">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 22</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Remove saved URLs: opens a dialog to remove the saved URLs from the configuration folder.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="773bfa43-e162-4c9a-8a93-47805e9a311b">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 23</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Close.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="2577c32e-c62b-4db2-a5b4-018df80ace58">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 25</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Changes for 8.0.0 ##</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="24b774e9-770d-46db-b853-fa5e91e0301e">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 27</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: * </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Added a readonly box with details about the selected URL.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="ed145c7a-e331-4689-acc6-2ad9efb42bb3">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 29</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ## </note>
